B.Q9=new A.di("Account details (phone number, name, photos, profile preferences), your precise location when you drop a pin, your messages, device information, and how you use the app (drops, swipes, reports). Payment is handled by the app store \u2014 we never see your card details.","What we collect")
B.PT=new A.di("To show you nearby people, power matching and chat, process your Swifflyy Plus purchases, keep the service safe, and improve Swifflyy. Location is only used to place a drop and find people near you.","How we use it")
B.PH=new A.di("Location is read only while you are using Swifflyy \u2014 never in the background. A drop stores your location for one hour, after which it expires and is no longer shown to others. You can remove an active drop at any time from the map. On iOS, turning off Precise Location blurs your position to several kilometres, which is too coarse for a 1 km radius.","Location data")
B.PY=new A.di("The selfie you take to get verified is compared against your own profile photos and then discarded immediately. We never store it, never add it to your profile, and never show it to anyone. Only the result, a score and the date are kept. Verification is optional.","Your verification selfie")
B.Qf=new A.di("Chats are stored so they can be delivered and so your history is there when you return, and are encrypted in transit. They are not end-to-end encrypted: we can access a conversation when it is reported, to investigate abuse. We never read chats otherwise and never use them for advertising.","Messages")
B.PI=new A.di("We ask for your email address when you set up your profile and use it for account notices. Promotional emails, tips and updates are sent only if you tick the box when you set up your profile; every such email has a one-click unsubscribe link, and you can also ask us to stop at any time.","Email & marketing")
B.Pw=new A.di("Other users see your first name, photos, profile details and drop location while a drop is active. We use service providers (hosting, maps, payments, push notifications) who process data on our behalf. We do not sell your personal data.","Who we share with")
B.Q4=new A.di("You can edit your profile, turn notifications on or off, revoke location permission in your device settings, block or report anyone you have matched with, and delete your account at any time from Settings \u2192 Delete account. Deleting is immediate and permanent: it removes your profile and photos, likes and passes, matches, chats, drops, subscription records and reports.","Your choices")
B.Qh=new A.di("Questions about privacy? Email support@swifflyy.com. The full policy is at swifflyy.com/privacy.html. Effective 8 September 2026.","Contact")
B.l1=s([B.Q9,B.PT,B.PH,B.PY,B.Qf,B.PI,B.Pw,B.Q4,B.Qh],t.FX)
B.Py=new A.di("Swifflyy is for real adults meeting real people nearby. We have zero tolerance for objectionable content and abusive behaviour: accounts that break these rules are removed, sometimes without warning, and we cooperate with law enforcement where the law requires it.","Zero tolerance")
B.PA=new A.di("\u2022 Nudity, sexually explicit content or sexual solicitation.\n\u2022 Harassment, threats, bullying, hate speech or discrimination.\n\u2022 Anything involving minors. Swifflyy is 18+ only; any sexualisation of a minor is reported to the authorities and results in a permanent ban.\n\u2022 Impersonation, fake profiles, or photos that are not of you.\n\u2022 Spam, scams, commercial solicitation, or asking for money or financial details.\n\u2022 Violence, self-harm, illegal drugs or other unlawful activity.\n\u2022 Sharing someone else's private information, photos or messages without consent.","Not allowed")
B.Q6=new A.di("Use recent photos of yourself that clearly show your face. No nudity or underwear shots, no children on their own, no watermarks, contact details or promotional text. Prompt answers and bios must follow the same rules as photos.","Your profile and photos")
B.Qg=new A.di('If someone makes you uncomfortable, open their profile or chat and tap "Report, block & unmatch". Blocking is immediate: the match is removed and that person can no longer reach you or appear in your deck. Every report is reviewed by our team, normally within 24 hours. When a chat is reported we can read that conversation to investigate.',"Report & block")
B.PN=new A.di("Depending on severity we warn, remove content, suspend, or permanently ban the account. Bans apply to the person, not just the profile \u2014 creating a new account to get around one is itself a violation. To appeal a decision, email support@swifflyy.com from your registered details.","Enforcement")
B.Q7=new A.di("Report anything urgent to support@swifflyy.com. The full policy is at swifflyy.com/content-policy.html. Effective 8 September 2026.","Contact")
B.pk=s([B.Py,B.PA,B.Q6,B.Qg,B.PN,B.Q7],t.FX)
